---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { getTranslations } from '../../lib/i18n';

const lang = 'en';
const t = getTranslations(lang);
---

<Layout lang={lang} title="Copyright Policy & Takedown" description="Policies regarding original creator attribution, legal aggregation boundaries, and takedown procedures.">
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8">
    <header class="pb-6 border-b border-[var(--border-color)]">
      <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-[var(--accent)] mb-2">
        $ legal --copyright-policy
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-[var(--text-primary)] tracking-tight mb-3">
        Copyright Policy & Takedown Procedure
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed font-mono">
        We are deeply committed to respecting the intellectual property rights of creators and publishing organizations.
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-[var(--text-secondary)] leading-relaxed font-sans">
      <section class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-color)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)] p-6 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] font-mono">
          # 1. Aggregator Model (Fair Use & Direct Attribution)
        </h2>
        <p>
          tips.hub operates strictly as an excerpt aggregator:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-xs font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] pl-2">
          <li><strong>No Full-Text Copying:</strong> We never reproduce full articles. Only standardized titles and short excerpts (under 280 characters) are indexed.</li>
          <li><strong>Always Direct Links:</strong> Every tip links directly to the canonical source URL.</li>
          <li><strong>No Image Re-hosting:</strong> We do not download or host source images.</li>
          <li><strong>Robots.txt Adherence:</strong> Our crawlers only process public RSS/Atom feeds and honor crawl-delay guidelines.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-color)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)] p-6 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] font-mono">
          # 2. Machine Translations
        </h2>
        <p>
          Translations are automated machine outputs to help developers across languages. If any nuance is lost, the author's original article is always the sole authority.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-color)] bg-[var(--bg-surface)] p-6 space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)] font-mono">
          # 3. Takedown Requests
        </h2>
        <p>
          If you are an author or publisher and prefer your content excluded from tips.hub, simply let us know:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-xs font-mono text-[var(--text-secondary)] pl-2">
          <li>Open an Issue on our GitHub Repository: <code>[Takedown] &lt;URL or Source Name&gt;</code>.</li>
          <li>Email our maintainers: <code>tips-admin@users.noreply.github.com</code>.</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="text-xs font-mono text-[var(--accent)] mt-2">
          We guarantee removal within 24–48 business hours.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
